{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vPUNFKgU9d1795107497.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>銅鑼灣有連鎖電器舖懷疑被盜竊，損失約188萬元貨物。</p><p></p><p>事發在時代廣場一間店鋪，警方晚上近七時接獲店鋪負責人報案，指有61部相機及55個相機鏡頭懷疑被盜去，總值約188萬元，案件暫時列作盜竊案。警方正追捕一名年約40歲男子。</p><p></p><p>據了解涉事店鋪是豐澤電器，男子是店鋪職員。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T17:21:14.841305+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T15:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T17:14:28.951210+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T17:14:28.951210+00:00","content_hash":"1324f14b9b896a0fb1b4e2a8d6f9f8ca1775d0ac1f5b66178a491685eb11ad5d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}